# Driving Data Analysis Demo

## Overview
This project demonstrates basic ingestion, querying, and analysis of structured system and driving-related data using Elasticsearch and Python. The goal is to explore data quality, error patterns, and release readiness signals in a production-style workflow.

## What This Shows
- Understanding of real-world, noisy system data
- Basic use of Elasticsearch for ingestion and querying
- Data-driven analysis to support release and operational decisions
- Clear documentation of assumptions and limitations

## Tools Used
- Python
- Elasticsearch
- Kibana
- Docker

## Project Structure
- `data/` – Sample datasets
- `scripts/` – Ingestion and analysis scripts
- `notebooks/` – Exploratory analysis
- `README.md` – Project overview

## Notes
This project focuses on system-level analysis and delivery insights rather than model development.